  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Stronger Threads for Functional 3D Prints"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Printed plastic threads can wear out or strip over time, especially in parts that are assembled and disassembled repeatedly. Brass heat-set inserts provide durable metal threads, helping improve assembly strength and making printed parts more suitable for repeated fastening."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Dedicated Tips for Direct Heat-Insert Installation"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The 100W USB‑C Smart Soldering Iron Kit includes two custom tips designed specifically for heat-set insert installation, allowing inserts to be installed directly with fast heating and accurate control. This provides a cleaner and more reliable way to add threaded metal fastening points to printed parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Multiple Sizes for Common Insert Standards"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The included heat-insert tooling supports common insert sizes used in 3D printing, including M2, M2.5, M3, M4, M5, M6, and M8. This makes it easier to handle a wide range of printed enclosures, brackets, and functional assemblies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Straighter Installation with Better Control"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Compared with using a standard soldering tip directly, dedicated insert tips help guide heat-set inserts more steadily during installation. This reduces the risk of tilting, slipping, or uneven insertion, which is especially important for printed parts that require accurate alignment and secure fastening."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Fast USB‑C Heating with Accurate Temperature Control"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "With USB‑C PD/QC input, the soldering iron supports fast heat-up and accurate temperature control in a compact form factor. A temperature range of 100–450°C ±5°C and a heat-up time of 2 seconds at 100W make it suitable for both soldering tasks and heat-insert installation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "3D Model"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Includes a 3D model file of the soldering iron for holder or fixture design."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Stronger Threads for Functional 3D Prints</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Printed plastic threads can wear out or strip over time, especially in parts that are assembled and disassembled repeatedly. Brass heat-set inserts provide durable metal threads, helping improve assembly strength and making printed parts more suitable for repeated fastening.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/494bc397318246cabe06ba1155b3efe3/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/494bc397318246cabe06ba1155b3efe3/11.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Dedicated Tips for Direct Heat-Insert Installation</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The 100W USB‑C Smart Soldering Iron Kit includes two custom tips designed specifically for heat-set insert installation, allowing inserts to be installed directly with fast heating and accurate control. This provides a cleaner and more reliable way to add threaded metal fastening points to printed parts.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/57cf4d0a89294e56b4904ffbbfc907ad/22.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/57cf4d0a89294e56b4904ffbbfc907ad/22.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第三条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Multiple Sizes for Common Insert Standards</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The included heat-insert tooling supports common insert sizes used in 3D printing, including M2, M2.5, M3, M4, M5, M6, and M8. This makes it easier to handle a wide range of printed enclosures, brackets, and functional assemblies.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/c6fa662995fa4247b8f20c1caf5b90f2/B-QA004_banner_3_1.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/c6fa662995fa4247b8f20c1caf5b90f2/B-QA004_banner_3_1.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第四条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Straighter Installation with Better Control</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">Compared with using a standard soldering tip directly, dedicated insert tips help guide heat-set inserts more steadily during installation. This reduces the risk of tilting, slipping, or uneven insertion, which is especially important for printed parts that require accurate alignment and secure fastening.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/3c4f344cde264314b3a7e3d4c8b5adb2/44.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"图片加载失败文案\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/3c4f344cde264314b3a7e3d4c8b5adb2/44.jpg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<br/><br/><br/><!-- 第五条 --><!-- 标题加文案加大图部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_t\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fast USB‑C Heating with Accurate Temperature Control</span></h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\" style=\"text-align: left;\">With USB‑C PD/QC input, the soldering iron supports fast heat-up and accurate temperature control in a compact form factor. A temperature range of 100–450°C ±5°C and a heat-up time of 2 seconds at 100W make it suitable for both soldering tasks and heat-insert installation.</p>\n</div>\n<br/><br/><br/>\n<div class=\"pct_t-p\"></div>\n<p><video autoplay=\"autoplay\" height=\"150\" loop=\"loop\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\" width=\"300\">\n<!-- 手机端 -->\n<source media=\"(max-width: 767px)\" src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f3541b89087045388cfad7842d79dd72/55.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/>\n<!-- PC端 -->\n<source media=\"(min-width: 768px)\" src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f3541b89087045388cfad7842d79dd72/55.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/>\n</video></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/ff74dd3adb33423babf85412a188ed33/HS-02.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://